## 4. Post-Search Scoring & Threshold Filtering

After getting ES hits, apply a secondary token-similarity score and filter by threshold:

```java
double threshold = 0.7; // configurable

for (Hit<T> hit : response.hits().hits()) {
  double esScore         = hit.score() != null ? hit.score() : 0.0;
  double normalizedScore = esScore / 10.0;
  double tokenSimilarity = normalizer.calculateSimilarity(inputName, doc.getFullName());
  double finalScore      = Math.max(normalizedScore, tokenSimilarity);

  if (finalScore < threshold) continue;

  // determine why it matched
  String reason = determineMatchReason(inputName, doc.getFullName(), normalizer);
}
```

### Match Reason Classifier

```java
private String determineMatchReason(String input, String stored, NameNormalizer normalizer) {
  if (normalizer.normalize(input).equals(normalizer.normalize(stored)))
    return "EXACT_MATCH";

  if (normalizer.removeSpaces(input).equals(normalizer.removeSpaces(stored)))
    return "NO_SPACE_MATCH";

  Set<String> s1 = new HashSet<>(normalizer.tokenize(input));
  Set<String> s2 = new HashSet<>(normalizer.tokenize(stored));
  if (s1.equals(s2))
    return "ORDER_AGNOSTIC_MATCH";

  return "PARTIAL_MATCH";
}
```

